This was only my fourth ascension since i started playing. And it has
been a long time since the one before this one. I started playing
around 86, my first ascension was a Priest 97, and the last before
this one was a Samurai in 99, with a Valk in between in 98. :) The
main reason for that is that i actually managed not to play for number
of years between 99 and now.

I got an early wish wich i used for a +3 [SDSM and found a pair of
speed boots quite early. Unfortunately i did not have any magic
resistance. So in the mines i ran into a poly trap which turned me
into a silver dragon. And while polymorphed i ran into a SECOND trap,
turning me into a H and ruining what little i had in armour. And later
i ran into another trap and got turned into a Stalker. Now i did not
realize this, but a stalker is permanently stunned. Well there went my
equipment, including stormbringer which i dont know where it
dissapered. Fortunately there was a ghost level in mine town that had
a cursed +2 SDSM. And from there it was building up an ascension kit
from scratch. 

Now the next time i get a which im not sure if i am going to wish for
a [GDSM or  a [SDSM. Both have advantages. With the GDSM you dont have
to worry about polymorph. On the other hand if you have a GDSM then i
cant use my favourite combo. "AoMB and #twoweapon since relflection is
either in off-hand or an amulet. Well decisions decisions.... 

After clearing mines i headed down. By the time i hit Medusa i was
level14 and had decent gear. So i collected my things and went back up
and did the Quest and cleared out Ludios. This gave me enough potions
and scrolls to scribe on and enough tools and rings to polypile for
more candles, =oL and more magic markers. I needed more 
candles nice there was only 2 in the entire minetown. Most shoppes was
robbed and all i could find was the two in the ghost pile.

By this time i had sort of an ascension kit (TM). I used gauntlets of
dex in stead of power,  and a rustproof dwarven helmet instead of
brilliance. At least my AC was low enough to head down to the castle.
The /WoW had three charges and that was more than enough to give me
the missing helmet, and enough magic markers to get my AC down to a
decent level. By the time i was finished my AC was -40. And i was
#twoweaponing the +6 Frost  Brand and a +5 chrysknife. Yes chrysknife.
Im all in favour of old traditions. :)

I only had 2 altar rooms in the entire game. The one in minetown and
the one in Valley of the dead. But the spoils from Ludios was more
than enough to get my AC down a good bit. :)

After the castle it was smooth sailing. Nothing much bothered me by
this point. Actually this endgame felt like the easiest one yet. And i
didn't do any nursedancing either. :) When i got to the Astral plane
the altar i was looking for was the third one of course. I #offered
the amulet and....

Time to start working on another class then. Expect another YAAP in
about 5-6 years or so. :)

